# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system 0e86dd631e47a44a7f06259aca575caf76591e5b219680f6dbcebc59abea5410
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 3fa34f65e7eaeedb8b7ddfc00f723d63fb82333b6821515f99365919fa298225
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm 5e14c85a7955d11586d95f1a6e88d38b154c4b6b74857b172fdd6dd064d4a785
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xclock 884071539f1a2c2a78f9f90cdbeea145b8e10e7462ea6cc269813a1657936ca3
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xeyes 1e8c4335d3693a60c922bb9929695769805230dd2493d72b9ba1e2e8670e4ca5
